  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vcard\" style=\"width: 22em\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" class=\"n\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 125%\"><span class=\"fn\">Horace Fadel</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c1/Horace_Fadel_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20170805174900\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c1/Horace_Fadel_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/265?cb=20170805174900\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"322\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Horace Fadel Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"Horace_Fadel_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:110%;\"><hr /><div style=\"background:lavender;\"><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"President of the United States\">55th</a>&#160;President of the United States</div>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:none; text-align:center;\"><b>In&#160;office</b><br />January 20, 2077&#160;&#8211;&#160;January 20, 2081\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Vice&#160;President\n</th>\n<td>Lisa Chan\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Preceded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lise_Duchesne\" title=\"Lise Duchesne\">Lise Duchesne</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Succeeded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Oscar_Lachman\" title=\"Oscar Lachman\">Oscar Lachman</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Born\n</th>\n<td>2029<br />Lewiston, Idaho\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Died\n</th>\n<td>2144<br />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Nationality\n</th>\n<td>American\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th>Political&#160;party\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Progress_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Progress Party (United States)\">Progress</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Profession\n</th>\n<td>Civil Servant<br />Politician\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Religion\n</th>\n<td>Sunni Islam\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Horace Fadel</b>&#160;(2029&#160;–&#160;2144) was an American politician who served as the 55th President of the United States from 2077 to 2081 during the Second Depression. A Progressive, as Secretary of Labor in the 2060s he introduced <a href=\"/wiki/Artificial-Intelligence_Operating_System\" title=\"Artificial-Intelligence Operating System\">AIOS</a> systems into labor management boards to increase the efficiency of hiring practices and provided government support for the adoption of post-war labor saving technologies. As president from 2077 to 2081, his ambitious programs were overwhelmed by the Second Depression, which seemed to get worse every year despite the increasingly large-scale interventions he made in the economy. He was defeated in a landslide in 2081 by Horizon Party candidate <a href=\"/wiki/Oscar_Lachman\" title=\"Oscar Lachman\">Oscar Lachman</a>, and spent the rest of his life as a progressive denouncing right-wing policies, as Horizon politicians repeatedly used his Depression record to attack progressive and justify the reforms to the economy.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Legacy\">Legacy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHorace_Fadel%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Fadel became a progressive spokesman in opposition to the domestic and foreign policies of the Horizon party. He opposed Lachman's deportation programs and the&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Second_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Second Mexican-American War\">Second Mexican-American War</a>. He had better relations with President <a href=\"/wiki/Seras_Stultz\" title=\"Seras Stultz\">Seras Stultz</a> , and Fadel helped produce a number of reports that changed U.S. occupation policy in Panama. By the time of his death in 2144, he had rehabilitated his image. Nevertheless, Fadel is generally not ranked highly in historical rankings of Presidents of the United States.\n</p><p>Many historians had compared his presidency to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herbert_Hoover\">Herbert Hoover</a>. Citing that both Fadel and Hoover's rise to power and were both very similar and is just another example of the repeat of history.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261118142853\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.094 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7558/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7563/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2446/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 619127/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   75.750      1 Template:Infobox_officeholder\n100.00%   75.750      1 -total\n 61.38%   46.492     16 Template:Infobox_officeholder/Office\n 18.13%   13.731      1 Template:Infobox_officeholder/Personal_data\n  8.63%    6.535      1 Template:DPP\n  6.64%    5.030      1 Template:DPP/logo\n  4.42%    3.350      1 Template:IsValidPageName\n  3.53%    2.675      2 Template:KMT\n  2.81%    2.126      1 Template:Px\n  1.67%    1.267      1 Template:KMT/logo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1375-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261118142853 and revision id 11626. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
